[h1]Happy Trails[/h1]

[b]Dynamic tracks and terrain wear for Project Zomboid Build 42.[/b]

Happy Trails is currently in pre-alpha development and is not yet published as a functional gameplay release.

The project is being designed so repeated vehicle travel can leave temporary tire/material marks and gradually create persistent worn paths, ruts, and informal roads while keeping multiplayer persistence and performance bounded.

[h2]Current status[/h2]

SPIKE-001 feasibility work is still in progress. See the GitHub repository documentation for the current roadmap, architecture, and validation status before treating any development snapshot as a release build.

[h2]License / status[/h2]

Happy Trails is an unofficial community mod for Project Zomboid and is not affiliated with or endorsed by The Indie Stone.
